# Go conventions

See [docs/ARCHITECTURE.md](docs/ARCHITECTURE.md).

## Package

- Single root package `baselines`
- Module: `github.com/eduard-kolotushin/timeseries-baselines`
- Go 1.26+

## API

- Config from env/flags; `Validate` before run
- `Publisher.Run` blocks until context cancel
- Do not mutate caller series

## Quality

- Table-driven tests next to code
- No drive-by refactors
- Fit and forecast stay linear-time (see performance.mdc)
